---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "New Arrivals - J.S.HANDLOOM"
description: "Our next saree collection is on the loom. Get notified on WhatsApp the moment it arrives."
permalink: /new-arrivals/
styles:
  - coming-soon
---
<section id="coming-soon" class="coming-soon">
  <div class="coming-soon-container">
    {% responsiveImg "saree-cartoon.png", "Saree Cartoon", "", "160px", [160, 320], ["webp", "png"] %}
    <h1>Our Next Collection Is On The Loom.</h1>
    <p>
      New Murshidabad and Muslin silk designs are being woven right now. Message us on WhatsApp and we'll
      notify you the moment they arrive, or follow along on Facebook for behind-the-scenes weaving updates.
    </p>
    <div class="coming-soon-ctas">
      <a class="cta shake" href="{{ ('Hi, please let me know when your new saree collection arrives!') | whatsappLink(site.whatsappNumber) }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        {% from "partials/icons.njk" import whatsapp %}
        {{ whatsapp("#fff", 20) }}
        Notify Me on WhatsApp
      </a>
      <a class="cta" href="{{ site.social.facebook }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        {% from "partials/icons.njk" import facebook %}
        {{ facebook("#fff", 20) }}
        Explore More on Facebook &rarr;
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="weaving-animation">
    <div class="thread thread-1"></div>
    <div class="thread thread-2"></div>
    <div class="thread thread-3"></div>
  </div>
</section>
